    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30293" root="علق" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُلُوقٌ</span></b>  [originally an inf. n.]: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُلْقَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  One
says also, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِى فِى الأَمْرِ عُلُوقٌ</span> <i>There is something
made obligatory to me,</i> or <i>in my favour, in the
affair,</i> or <i>case;</i> and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَعَلَّقٌ</span></b> . (TA.)

